    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=4$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3e^{2\\ln x}&=48\\\\3e^{\\ln x^2}&=48\\\\3x^2&=48\\\\x^2&=16\\\\x&=\\pm4\\end{align*}$$Since $x>0$, $x=4$.",
